### run_tests

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl run_tests tests : () =\n    real\n        inl tests =\n            real_core.record_map\n                fun { key value } =>\n                    (fun _ => value ()) : string -> ()\n                tests\n        run_tests' `(`tests) tests","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl run_tests tests : () =
      real
          inl tests =
              real_core.record_map
                  fun { key value } =>
                      (fun _ => value ()) : string -> ()
                  tests
          run_tests' `(`tests) tests
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test\n///> rust -d encoding_rs encoding_rs_io\n\nfun () =>\n    run_tests {\n        a = fun () => \"a\" |> _assert_eq \"a\"\n    }\n|> run","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

